OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F413A1786465167
OL,3,CDecision needs to be made at 'highest
OL,4,Clevel' of Government over NI budget
OL,6,FIt is time for a decision to be made
OL,7,Fat the "highest level" of the UK
OL,8,FGovernment over increased funding for
OL,9,Fpublic services in Northern Ireland,
OL,10,FFinance Minister John O'Dowd has said.
OL,12,FMr O'Dowd said Westminster was being
OL,13,F"unfair" to people in the region due
OL,14,Fto the funding package currently
OL,15,Fallocated to Stormont.
OL,17,FUlster Unionist Health Minister Mike
OL,18,FNesbitt said an additional #3 billion
OL,19,Fin funding would put Northern Ireland
OL,20,Fin "quite a comfortable place".
OL,26,@oD@HOUoD@VO]uD@AOUuD@HO]|D@DOU|D@^O]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G1/13
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,414,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41302
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F413A1786465167
OL,3,CDecision needs to be made at 'highest
OL,4,Clevel' of Government over NI budget
OL,6,FMr Nesbitt also said he believes the
OL,7,Freason why new Prime Minister Andy
OL,8,FBurnham has not yet visited the region
OL,9,Fsince taking up office is because he
OL,10,F"doesn't have news yet" on a revised
OL,11,Fbudget settlement.
OL,13,FStormont ministers have been unable to
OL,14,Fagree a budget for the current
OL,15,Ffinancial year, with departments
OL,16,Foperating on contingency budgets since
OL,17,FApril.
OL,26,@rD@AOUrD@WO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G2/13
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,414,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F413A1786465167
OL,3,CDecision needs to be made at 'highest
OL,4,Clevel' of Government over NI budget
OL,6,FMinisters across the four-party
OL,7,FExecutive have consistently made the
OL,8,Fpoint that they need more money from
OL,9,Fthe Treasury to address a funding
OL,10,Fcrisis facing public services in the
OL,11,Fregion.
OL,13,FOn Monday, Mr O'Dowd said he had
OL,14,Fwritten to Chancellor John Healey
OL,15,Frequestion an "urgent meeting" to
OL,16,Fdiscuss finances in the region.
OL,26,@wD@OOUwD@^O]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G3/13
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,414,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F413A1786465167
OL,3,CDecision needs to be made at 'highest
OL,4,Clevel' of Government over NI budget
OL,6,FSpeaking on Tuesday, Mr O'Dowd said:
OL,7,F"One of the keys to tackling waiting
OL,8,Flists and stabilising our health
OL,9,Fservices is a multi-year budget, and
OL,10,Fto achieve that, we need to see a
OL,11,Ffairer funding settlement coming
OL,12,Fforward from the Chancellor.
OL,14,F"I'm on record as saying, as is the
OL,15,FFiscal Council, that Scotland's funded
OL,16,F#3 billion above its level of need,
OL,17,FWales is funded #1 billion above its
OL,18,Flevel of need, and we are funded under
OL,19,Four level of need.
OL,26,@oD@AOUvD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G4/13
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,414,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41305
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F413A1786465167
OL,3,CDecision needs to be made at 'highest
OL,4,Clevel' of Government over NI budget
OL,6,F"So, how are ministers expected to
OL,7,Fdrive forward the changes that are
OL,8,Frequired with those sorts of figures?"
OL,10,FMr O'Dowd said discussions with
OL,11,FTreasury officials had been taking
OL,12,Fplace for several months.
OL,14,FHe added: "What we need now is a
OL,15,Fdecision, and the people who make
OL,16,Fdecisions around the cabinet table are
OL,17,Fthe Chancellor and the Prime Minister.
OL,26,@nD@AOUpD@fO]vD@KOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G5/13
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,414,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41306
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F413A1786465167
OL,3,CDecision needs to be made at 'highest
OL,4,Clevel' of Government over NI budget
OL,6,F"So that's why I have written to the
OL,7,FChancellor asking for a meeting
OL,8,Fbecause this needs to be raised to the
OL,9,Fhighest levels of the British
OL,10,FGovernment, and decisions have to be
OL,11,Fmade, and a fair and sustainable
OL,12,Ffunding package has to be delivered to
OL,13,Fthe people here.
OL,15,F"If the British Government are
OL,16,Fignoring us as the elected
OL,17,Frepresentatives of the people here,
OL,18,Fthat's a question that needs to be
OL,19,Fposed to the British Government, why
OL,20,Fthey're treating us with such
OL,21,Fdisrespect?"
OL,26,@nD@AOUwD@AOU}D@LO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G6/13
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,414,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41307
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F413A1786465167
OL,3,CDecision needs to be made at 'highest
OL,4,Clevel' of Government over NI budget
OL,6,FMr O'Dowd insisted again that the
OL,7,Fpower sharing Executive would not
OL,8,Fconsider raising revenue internally
OL,9,Fthrough the introduction of water
OL,10,Fcharges.
OL,12,FHe said: "Putting further financial
OL,13,Fburden on hard-pressed families and
OL,14,Fworkers isn't the way forward.
OL,16,F"Scotland and Wales raised water
OL,17,Fcharges, but still are funded well
OL,18,Fabove their level of need.
OL,26,@tD@JOUxD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G7/13
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,414,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41308
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F413A1786465167
OL,3,CDecision needs to be made at 'highest
OL,4,Clevel' of Government over NI budget
OL,6,F"So the question isn't about revenue
OL,7,Fraising; it's about fairness and the
OL,8,Frecognition by the British Government
OL,9,Fthat are being unfair to the people
OL,10,Fwho live here, the working families
OL,11,Fand taxpayers who go out every day to
OL,12,Fdo their bit, the businesses who are
OL,13,Frunning and creating employment ` they
OL,14,Fare all being treated unfairly.
OL,16,F"That needs to be corrected."
OL,18,FMr Nesbitt said he was "not surprised"
OL,19,Fthat Mr Burnham had yet to visit
OL,20,FNorthern Ireland since becoming Prime
OL,21,FMinister.
OL,26,@nD@AOUxD@AOUxD@]O]zD@XOUzD@fO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G8/13
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,414,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41309
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F413A1786465167
OL,3,CDecision needs to be made at 'highest
OL,4,Clevel' of Government over NI budget
OL,6,FHe said: "Just before he took office,
OL,7,Fwe opened negotiations with Treasury
OL,8,Fand the Northern Ireland Office on the
OL,9,Fbudget. Those talks are unresolved.
OL,11,F"The first question you're going to
OL,12,Fask him, if and when he does come to
OL,13,FNorthern Ireland, is what about the
OL,14,Fbudget?
OL,16,F"And he doesn't have the answer to
OL,17,Fthat yet.
OL,26,@nD@JOUsD@AOUxD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G9/13
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,414,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41310
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F413A1786465167
OL,3,CDecision needs to be made at 'highest
OL,4,Clevel' of Government over NI budget
OL,6,F"We are missing out, not on hundreds
OL,7,Fof thousands, not on millions, but on
OL,8,Fbillions of pounds in terms of the
OL,9,Fcomparison with Wales and Scotland.
OL,11,F"And if we were to get another #3
OL,12,Fbillion, I think John would agree, we
OL,13,Fwould be in actually quite a
OL,14,Fcomfortable place."
OL,16,FThe minister added: "I think he's (Mr
OL,17,FBurnham) not here because he doesn't
OL,18,Fhave news yet."
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@AOUvD@SO]xD@UOUzD@OO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}           G10/13
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
