OL,3,CDecision needs to be made at 'highest
OL,4,Clevel' of Government over NI budget
OL,6,FNorthern Ireland's health service is
OL,7,Fheading towards a "very bad place" in
OL,8,Fthe absence of an agreed budget at
OL,9,FStormont, Mike Nesbitt has said.
OL,11,FThe Health Minister said he was
OL,12,Fcurrently unable to facilitate pay
OL,13,Fawards for healthcare staff and warned
OL,14,Fabout the likelihood of further
OL,15,Findustrial action by workers.
OL,17,FMr Nesbitt said the "pressing issue"
OL,18,Ffor his department is pay.
OL,26,@oD@SOUoD@bO]yD@UOUyD@dO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}           G11/13
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,414,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41312
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F413A1786465167
OL,3,CDecision needs to be made at 'highest
OL,4,Clevel' of Government over NI budget
OL,6,FHe said: "There are two independent
OL,7,Fbodies who recommend (pay awards) for
OL,8,Fdoctors and dentists and for Agenda
OL,9,Ffor Change staff.
OL,11,F"They made their recommendations
OL,12,Fmonths ago.
OL,14,F"I am unable to facilitate the payment
OL,15,Fof those pay rises or pay increases,
OL,16,Fpay awards without a budget.
OL,18,F"We've seen BMA consultants and
OL,19,Fresidents, especially doctors, engage
OL,20,Fin strike action.
OL,26,@nD@JOUsD@AOUvD@AOUzD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}           G12/13
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,414,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41313
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F413A1786465167
OL,3,CDecision needs to be made at 'highest
OL,4,Clevel' of Government over NI budget
OL,6,F"I believe we're not far from the
OL,7,FRoyal College of Nursing balloting
OL,8,Ftheir members about industrial action.
OL,10,F"So we are heading towards a very bad
OL,11,Fplace."
